A||||2||Raydar||Ever Tried to Alphabetize Your Favorites?||||6||
Z||000000||Raydar||12-01-2001||07:23 PM||||Tammy asked me how to sort her Favorites, in Alphabetical order. After supporting various Microsoft products for three years, I still couldn't tell her.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>But I did find it on the ARS forum... <BR>Click on the Favorites list like you're going to click on a link. Pick a place in the menu and right click. Click on Sort by Name. You can sort the links in the subfolders the same way.  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||6
Z||000001||WampusCat||12-01-2001||08:12 PM||||Good tip, thanks!||||reg||10
